# Background Remover runs ONNX Runtime's WASM build, which asks for one thread
# per CPU core. Threads need SharedArrayBuffer, which the browser only grants to
# a cross-origin isolated document — so without these two headers the model runs
# single-threaded no matter how many cores the visitor has. Scoped to this one
# route: the page has no cross-origin subresources (the model and runtime are
# self-hosted), and isolating the whole site would risk third-party embeds.
/tools/background-remover/
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

/tools/background-remover/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
